ORIGIN AND ATTRIBUTION
----------------------
This repository is the Docker profile of the mrhOTshOT OT/ICS attack-simulation
lab, created and developed jointly by Asher Davila and Malav Vyas. Both are
equal authors of the work, which originated at github.com/MalavVyas/mrhOTshOT
and is published here with permission.

THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------
vendor/tricotools/
    Triconex TriStation honeypot from Nozomi Networks.
    Source: github.com/NozomiNetworks/tricotools
    Authors: Alessandro Di Pinto, Andrea Arteaga, Younes Dragoni
    Licensed under BSD 3-Clause. The original LICENSE and provenance README are
    retained in that directory unchanged.

The Docker images build on upstream projects that carry their own licenses and
are pulled at build time rather than vendored here:
    FUXA (frangoteam/fuxa), MITRE Caldera (ghcr.io/mitre/caldera) and its
    modbus, dnp3, bacnet and iec61850 plugins, Suricata (jasonish/suricata),
    and the c104, pymodbus, asyncua, python-snap7 and bacpypes3 Python packages.
